! TiddlyWiki 5 wikitext ~ the draft's record

The specification draft reads at <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/tiddlywiki-wikitext`>>; this record keeps how it reached its present text.

''The deep pass (the draft's revision note).'' A deep pass on two measured waves: the degradation law rewritten to the engine's real behavior (an unbound macro call renders as nothing, the parse stays total, storage round-trips verbatim), the extension mechanism stood up as a normative rule-object contract, the rule inventory corrected to real exported names (44), security gates measured, the test corpus cited as the executable conformance suite, references seated, and the document's voice held to TW5 ontology alone.

